  message: "Reproduced on fresh substrate (dogfood_tranche_07 F127.A1): the 'satisfied via PR1+PR5 sweeps' claim does not hold for bash cyclomatic_complexity. cyclomatic_complexity coverage on function|method nodes: bash 0/155 (0%) — LOC 100% but CC entirely null; solidity 0/2 and wgsl 0/3 are 0% on BOTH CC and LOC. Source: grep cyclomatic hits js_ts/go/swift/java/csharp/rust but 0 hits in bash.py. Real magnitude: poll_ci (243 LOC) and do_merge (296 LOC) carry CC=None. Fresh hypergumbo run on a /tmp bash fn with if/elif/else+for+while (true CC ~5) -> cyclomatic_complexity=None. TS improved to 100% since the original table but bash/solidity/wgsl persist. Reopened satisfied -> violated (invariant kind cannot use todo_hard)."  # 5b29
